@host = http://localhost:5080

### Generate a one-time password (valid for 30 seconds)
POST {{host}}/api/otp/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "john.doe",
  "dateTime": "2026-10-16T12:30:00.000Z"
}

### Validate a one-time password (replace the code with the one returned above)
POST {{host}}/api/otp/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "john.doe",
  "code": "123456"
}

### Validation error: missing user id (400)
POST {{host}}/api/otp/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "",
  "dateTime": "2026-10-16T12:30:00.000Z"
}
